CONTROLS
  PASS  CONTROL A1 a synthetic variant with a known endpoint tilt of -0.200 dex is recovered by the regression: -0.200000
  PASS  CONTROL A2 the pure-tilt table reproduces that variant's flat slope at t = -0.200 (interpolation tolerance 0.005): -0.2000
  PASS  MUTATE the lane's injected 0.2 (z - z_med) slope moves the zero-tilt flat slope by >= +0.19 (measured against CFG216's unmutated value): +0.2000

